{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-for-health-grossman","title":"健康的需求与 Grossman 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations/demand-for-health-grossman","wordCount":1620,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"健康的需求与-grossman-模型\">健康的需求与 Grossman 模型</h1><p>为什么一个二十岁的年轻人愿意每周跑步、定期体检，明明此刻身体好得很？为什么受教育程度越高的人普遍越健康，哪怕收入相同？为什么医疗支出会随年龄陡然上升？1972 年，Michael Grossman 用一个把健康当作「资本」的模型，一次性回答了这些看似无关的问题。这是健康经济学最重要的理论支柱，它把上一篇提出的<a href=\"intro-and-special-nature-of-health\">健康作为派生需求</a>的洞见，变成了一个可推导、可检验的数学框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Grossman 模型的核心隐喻是：健康不是一次性消费的商品，而是一笔可以投资、会随时间折旧的资本存量——就像一台机器、一栋房子或一份技能。你出生时被赋予一定的「健康资本存量」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它每年按一定比率折旧；你可以通过投入时间和医疗服务来「补充」它。人在每个时点要决定：投资多少在健康上，才能在「活得更久、更健康」与「把资源花在其他享受上」之间取得最优平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[初始健康资本 H0] --&gt; B[每期折旧&lt;br/&gt;随年龄加速]&#10;  C[健康投资 I&lt;br/&gt;医疗+时间+饮食运动] --&gt; D[健康资本存量 H]&#10;  B --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[更多健康时间&lt;br/&gt;可工作可享受]&#10;  D --&gt; F[消费品价值&lt;br/&gt;健康本身令人愉悦]&#10;  D --&gt; G[投资品价值&lt;br/&gt;健康换来工作收入]&#10;  E --&gt; H[效用最大化]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[初始健康资本 H0] --&gt; B[每期折旧&lt;br/&gt;随年龄加速]\n  C[健康投资 I&lt;br/&gt;医疗+时间+饮食运动] --&gt; D[健康资本存量 H]\n  B --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[更多健康时间&lt;br/&gt;可工作可享受]\n  D --&gt; F[消费品价值&lt;br/&gt;健康本身令人愉悦]\n  D --&gt; G[投资品价值&lt;br/&gt;健康换来工作收入]\n  E --&gt; H[效用最大化]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>模型最精妙之处在于它指出健康资本具有<strong>双重属性</strong>：既是消费品（健康本身让人感觉良好，是直接的效用来源），又是投资品（健康让你能工作、赚钱、享受其他消费）。下表对比这两种属性如何分别驱动健康需求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>政策/行为含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消费品属性</td>\n<td>健康本身带来效用，病痛带来负效用</td>\n<td>即使不工作的人（如退休者）也愿意为健康付费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资品属性</td>\n<td>健康提供「健康时间」，可用于工作赚钱</td>\n<td>健康投资回报随工资上升而上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资本折旧</td>\n<td>健康存量随年龄加速折旧</td>\n<td>解释老年医疗支出陡增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可生产性</td>\n<td>健康可由多种投入生产</td>\n<td>教育提高「生产健康的效率」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"健康资本的动态-折旧与投资的拉锯\">健康资本的动态：折旧与投资的拉锯</h2><p>把健康看作资本，最直接的推论是它服从一个资本积累方程。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 期的健康存量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，折旧率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，本期健康投资为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则下一期的健康存量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{t+1} = (1 - \\delta_t) H_t + I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个方程讲了一个朴素却深刻的故事：如果你什么都不做，健康每年自动缩水 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_t H_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；要维持甚至提升健康，就必须持续投资 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。关键在于折旧率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随年龄递增——年轻时身体「掉血」很慢，年老时同样的投资也越来越难抵消加速的折旧。当健康存量跌破某个「死亡阈值」时，生命终结。这个模型因此内生地解释了为什么人会变老、会死，以及为什么老年人即使投入更多医疗，健康仍在下滑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最优健康投资-边际收益等于边际成本\">最优健康投资：边际收益等于边际成本</h2><p>理性个体会把健康投资增加到「再多投一单位，所得恰好抵得上所费」为止。健康投资的边际收益来自两部分：投资品收益（多出的健康时间能赚的工资）与消费品收益（健康本身带来的效用）。边际成本则是投资的价格加上持有健康资本的机会成本（利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 加折旧率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>）。最优条件可写为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>健康的边际收益</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{健康的边际收益} = r + \\delta_t - \\tilde{\\pi}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">健康的边际收益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中右侧是持有健康资本的「使用成本」（user cost）。这个条件解释了诸多经验规律：折旧率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越高（年纪越大），均衡的健康存量越低，但所需的医疗投资 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 反而越多——这正是「越老越要看病、却越看越虚」的根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型解释的三大经验规律\">模型解释的三大经验规律</h2><p>Grossman 模型的威力在于，它用同一套逻辑解释了大量横跨人口学与健康经济学的观察事实：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>年龄—医疗支出曲线</strong>。折旧加速使老年人需要更多投资来维持哪怕更低的健康水平，故医疗支出随年龄陡升。这一规律是设计养老与医保筹资制度的基础，将在<a href=\"../systems-policy/health-financing-universal-coverage\">卫生筹资与全民健康覆盖</a>中再次出现。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>教育的健康回报</strong>。Grossman 假设教育提高了人「生产健康的效率」——受教育者用同样的投入能产出更多健康（更懂得遵医嘱、更会预防）。这解释了为什么控制收入后，教育仍与健康强相关，也呼应了<a href=\"../systems-policy/health-equity-social-determinants\">健康公平与社会决定因素</a>中教育作为关键社会决定因素的角色。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>工资与健康投资正相关</strong>。工资越高，「健康时间」越值钱，投资品属性的回报越大，于是高收入者投资更多于健康。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型的局限与延伸\">模型的局限与延伸</h2><p>Grossman 模型并非无懈可击。它假设个体完全理性、信息充分地规划终身健康，但现实中人们存在严重的现时偏误（明知抽烟有害仍抽）、信息匮乏（不知道自己需要什么治疗），以及在<a href=\"market-failure-information-asymmetry\">医疗市场失灵与信息不对称</a>中详述的种种障碍。此外，模型把健康投资当作个人完全可控的选择，忽略了基因、环境、社会结构等不可控因素。</p>\n<p>尽管如此，作为一个「健康为什么、何时、投资多少」的统一框架，Grossman 模型至今仍是分析健康需求的出发点。后续的行为健康经济学、健康的社会决定因素研究，大多是在它的骨架上添加现实的摩擦与约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Grossman 模型把健康视为会折旧、可投资的资本存量，统一解释了健康需求的诸多规律。</li>\n<li>健康资本具双重属性：既是消费品（本身带来效用），又是投资品（提供可工作的健康时间）。</li>\n<li>资本积累方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{t+1} = (1-\\delta_t)H_t + I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表明，不投资则健康自动折旧，折旧率随年龄加速。</li>\n<li>模型成功解释了年龄—支出曲线、教育的健康回报、工资与健康投资的正相关。</li>\n<li>其局限在于假设完全理性与信息充分，忽略了现时偏误与不可控的结构性因素，这些正是后续章节的修补对象。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"健康的需求与 Grossman 模型","id":"健康的需求与-grossman-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"健康资本的动态：折旧与投资的拉锯","id":"健康资本的动态-折旧与投资的拉锯"},{"level":2,"text":"最优健康投资：边际收益等于边际成本","id":"最优健康投资-边际收益等于边际成本"},{"level":2,"text":"模型解释的三大经验规律","id":"模型解释的三大经验规律"},{"level":2,"text":"模型的局限与延伸","id":"模型的局限与延伸"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"健康经济学导论与健康的特殊性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations/intro-and-special-nature-of-health"},"next":{"title":"医疗市场失灵与信息不对称","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations/market-failure-information-asymmetry"}}